{
  "title": "Namaz to Dispel Fear of Oppressors",
  "data": "Repeat the following one hundred times:\nيَا حَيُّ يَا قَيُّوْمُ\nYAA HAYYU YAA QAYYOOM\nO Ever-living! O Self-subsisting!\nيَا حَيًّا لَا اِلٰهَ اِلَّا اَنْتَ\nYAA HAYYAN LAA ILAAHA ILLAA ANT\nO Living One, there is no god but You!\nبِرَحْمَتِكَ اَسْتَغِيْثُ\nBIRAHMATIKA ASTAGHEETH\nI seek help through Your mercy;\nفَصَلِّ عَلٰى مُحَمَّدٍ وَّاٰلِ مُحَمَّدٍ\nFASALLI A'LAA MUHAMMADIN WA AALI MUHAMMAD\nso send blessings upon Muhammad and the Household of Muhammad,\nوَاَغِثْنِيْ السَّاعَةَ السَّاعَةَ\nWA AGHITHNIS SAA'ATAS SAA'AH\nand help me now, at this very hour!\nUpon accomplishment, say the following supplication:\nاَسْئَلُكَ اللّٰهُمَّ اَنْ تُصَلِّيَ عَلٰى مُحَمَّدٍ وَّاٰلِ مُحَمَّدٍ\nAS'ALUKAL LAAHUMMA AN TUSALLIYA A'LAA MUHAMMADIN WA AALI MUHAMMAD\nI ask You, O Allah, to send blessings upon Muhammad and the Household of Muhammad,\nوَاَنْ تَلْطُفَ لِيْ وَاَنْ تَغْلِبَ لِيْ\nWA AN TALTUFA LEE WA AN TAGHLIBA LEE\nto be subtle on my behalf, to prevail on my behalf,\nوَاَنْ تَمْكُرَ لِيْ وَاَنْ تَخْدَعَ لِيْ وَاَنْ تَكِيْدَ لِيْ\nWA AN TAMKURA LEE WA AN TAKHDA'A LEE WA AN TAKEEDA LEE\nand to plan, outwit and contrive on my behalf,\nوَاَنْ تَكْفِيَنِيْ مَؤُوْنَةَ فُلَانِ بْنِ فُلَانٍ\nWA AN TAKFIYANEE MA'OONATA FULAANIBNI FULAAN\nand to spare me the burden of so-and-so, son of so-and-so.\nMention the name of your enemy and his father's name in place of \"so-and-so, son of so-and-so\".",
  "merits": "As quoted from Makarim al-Akhlaq: bathe yourself (ghusl), offer a two-unit prayer, raise your garment so that your knees touch the place of prayer, and repeat the first supplication below one hundred times.\nThis is the supplicatory prayer of the Holy Prophet (s.a.w.a.) on the day of the Battle of Uhud."
}
